
<header class="pt-[clamp(48px,7vw,88px)] pb-[clamp(60px,7vw,100px)]">
<div class="max-w-[1140px] mx-auto px-7">
  <h1 class="font-disp font-semibold text-[clamp(2.7rem,6.4vw,5.4rem)] leading-[1.04] tracking-[-.02em] text-balance max-w-[16ch] [font-variation-settings:'opsz'_96]">give your community <span class="fire-text">a world of its own.</span></h1>
  <p class="mt-[26px] text-[clamp(1.12rem,1.7vw,1.32rem)] leading-normal text-ink-2 max-w-[40rem] [&_b]:text-ink [&_b]:font-semibold">A space a community owns together <b>shaped to how you already gather</b>, and <b>connected to everyone else</b> on your own terms.</p>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5 mt-[34px]">
    <a class="btn h-auto min-h-0 rounded-full border-0 px-6 py-[.9rem] font-smono text-[.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.05em] text-[#221302] bg-gradient-to-br from-spark via-flame to-ember hover:from-spark hover:via-flame hover:to-ember shadow-[0_6px_26px_-8px_rgba(232,145,43,.55)]" href="#join">Launch your community</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost h-auto min-h-0 rounded-full px-6 py-[.9rem] font-smono text-[.82rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.05em] text-ink border border-ink/15 bg-ink/[0.03] hover:border-flame hover:text-spark hover:bg-ink/[0.03]" href="#story">Explore ↓</a>
  </div>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-[30px] gap-y-2.5 mt-[42px] font-smono text-[.72rem] tracking-[.04em] text-ink-3">
    <span class="flex items-center gap-[9px]"><b class="text-spark">open source</b> · no VC · no ads</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-[9px]"><b class="text-spark">federated</b>, connected from day one</span>
    <span class="flex items-center gap-[9px]"><b class="text-spark">yours</b> to govern &amp; to leave</span>
  </div>
  <div class="relative mt-[52px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-ink/15">
    <img class="w-full block" src="/img/v2/invite_bg.jpg" alt="" fetchpriority="high">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none bg-[linear-gradient(to_top,rgba(12,14,21,.55),transparent_35%),radial-gradient(60%_50%_at_68%_62%,rgba(255,223,130,.12),transparent_70%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <span class="badge absolute right-4 bottom-3.5 z-[3] h-auto rounded font-smono text-[.64rem] tracking-[.14em] uppercase text-ink-2 bg-night/70 border-ink/15 px-2.5 py-[5px] backdrop-blur-sm">Illustration by Rocco Lombardi</span>
  </div>
</div></header>
